  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Friday 11 December 2026 at 1:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nYour coastal dream is right here. Just moments from the popular Waiake Beach!\r\n\r\nBeautifully crafted, with a solid rendered brick exterior and double glazed windows, this residence offers generous parking for all your toys and an enviable setting for enjoying the coastal lifestyle. Equally, it could be an ideal holiday retreat, with the potential to enjoy it for part of the year while spending the remaining months elsewhere.\r\n\r\nGenerous proportions, absolute privacy and a highly practical layout. The bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned away from the living areas, while a versatile self contained flexi-space on the ground level offers multiple possibilities to suit your needs.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully established and skillfully planted grounds create an instant holiday atmosphere, reminiscent of a Pacific five-star resort. Inside, the well-appointed kitchen offers abundant storage and generous bench space. \r\n\r\nAdditional features include ample storage, a ground-level workshop or potential wine cellar, and a handy study nook. \r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed with care and love, this is a truly unique opportunity to secure your private coastal haven!",
